PROVENANCE "characterized-* rows state the order of the guards in the C# code before step 7.2 G2 (CommandRouter.CheckGuards and BatchHelper.Execute at 3af1882b), which no test of the project pins: each has two guards true at once and expects the one the code reaches first; they are not endorsed, and a change of that order is a change of the requirement. The others: one row per guard test the project already has; expected is what the test asserts (a Process_* test that asserts a message is mapped to the guard that emits it). C#: CommandRouterTests.cs, CommandRouterReadOnlyTests.cs, BatchHelperReadOnlyTests.cs, BatchRejectionTests.cs; Python: test_middleware_play_guard.py, test_middleware_readonly.py, test_direct_only_gate.py. No Unity run: these are the tests as written."

